2c:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[null,["$","section","1-Choose a course before choosing a funding label",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Choose a course before choosing a funding label"}],[["$","p","Write down the qualification you want, two or three realistic subjects and the language in which you can study. A scholarship name does not establish that a particular course accepts international applicants or that its teaching language suits you. Compare the actual degree catalogue, compulsory modules and graduation requirements before committing to an application.",{"children":"Write down the qualification you want, two or three realistic subjects and the language in which you can study. A scholarship name does not establish that a particular course accepts international applicants or that its teaching language suits you. Compare the actual degree catalogue, compulsory modules and graduation requirements before committing to an application."}],["$","p","For a research degree, turn the subject into a specific question and identify relevant supervision. For a taught degree, compare prerequisites and assessment methods. A university that is famous overall may still be a poor fit for your intended specialism. Keep academic fit as a separate column from the funding decision.",{"children":"For a research degree, turn the subject into a specific question and identify relevant supervision. For a taught degree, compare prerequisites and assessment methods. A university that is famous overall may still be a poor fit for your intended specialism. Keep academic fit as a separate column from the funding decision."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L30",null,{"id":"countries/china:section-2","title":"Check your progress","items":["Degree level and prerequisite qualification match","Subject appears in the international programme catalogue","Teaching language and accepted evidence are confirmed","Scholarship explicitly covers the chosen course"]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Understand what fully funded leaves out",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Understand what fully funded leaves out"}],[["$","p","Compare tuition, accommodation, insurance and living support line by line. An award described as partial may reduce tuition without paying rent or food. Even a comprehensive award can leave travel, translations, medical examinations, visa processing and the period before the first allowance unpaid. Build an arrival reserve instead of assuming that a scholarship means no upfront spending.",{"children":"Compare tuition, accommodation, insurance and living support line by line. An award described as partial may reduce tuition without paying rent or food. Even a comprehensive award can leave travel, translations, medical examinations, visa processing and the period before the first allowance unpaid. Build an arrival reserve instead of assuming that a scholarship means no upfront spending."}],["$","p","Do not compare headline stipend amounts alone. Consider whether accommodation is supplied, whether you must share a room and whether support lasts for the full degree or is renewed after review. Ask for written clarification where the award notice does not identify the start of payments.",{"children":"Do not compare headline stipend amounts alone. Consider whether accommodation is supplied, whether you must share a room and whether support lasts for the full degree or is renewed after review. Ask for written clarification where the award notice does not identify the start of payments."}]],"$undefined","$L31","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37"]}]
